# Pointer for tools that expect `.env.example`.
#
# This project does not load a dotenv `.env` file. Local development uses
# Cloudflare Wrangler bindings plus `.dev.vars` (git-ignored):
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# The canonical, commented list of local keys lives in `.dev.vars.example`.
# Production values belong in `wrangler secret put` or the Cloudflare dashboard,
# never in a committed file. See docs/EXTERNAL_SETUP.md.
